  "dashboard": {
    "description": "Bounded private experiment. Counts are unique request IDs, latency is the serialized server model path excluding lock wait/network. PSI uses unique machine/feature-time snapshots and one fixed reference. Scores are uncalibrated; this dashboard does not measure accuracy or authorize promotion. Environment: Linux VM native model1 and6.",
